    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "professionals? i've been in the trenches with them for years. i know how it works. i know how it ends. it's just a cycle of pain. i look at these people and i see how much they suffer, and then i look at myself and i realize i'm just suffering right along with them. there's no winning here. it's just... constant, crushing weight. like there's no version of the future where this stops being exhausting. it's just a void.",
